  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mi></mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be a function defined as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>15</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>. Then,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi></math> is"
  },
