  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>15</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />Now, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Also, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Also, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> , clearly, <math><mi>f</mi></math> is not continuous for any values of <math><mi>a</mi></math> and <math><mi>b</mi></math> ."
